  "title": "Eva Live Inc. Engages Anderson Kill P.C. to Execute Nasdaq Tokenization Strategy for GOAI",
  "summary": "LAS VEGAS, NV, March 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Eva Live Inc. (NASDAQ: GOAI), a high-growth AI-driven digital advertising and marketing technology company, today announced that it has engaged Anderson Kill P.C. to actively support the Company’s execution of a strategic initiative to align GOAI with Nasdaq’s newly announced tokenization framework. The Anderson Kill P.C. team is led by […]",
